[00:01.00]作曲 : Sarah Skinner & Lost Sky
[00:02.02]作词 : Sarah Skinner & Lost Sky
[00:03.04]编曲 : Sarah Skinner & Lost Sky
[00:13.11]My heart rages around like an ocean in my head
{"我的心如怒海在脑海中翻腾"}
[00:18.78]Because there are so many things that I left unsaid
{"因为有太多话语我未曾说出口"}
[00:39.73]I can almost feel you wa-wa-walking in the distance
{"我几乎能感受到你远-远-远去的脚步"}
[00:45.45]But I know that is not reality
{"但我知道那并非现实"}
[00:51.92]If you are echoing around
{"若你的回声始终萦绕"}
[00:54.91]Inside these parallel dimensions all along
{"在这些平行维度之间徘徊"}
[01:00.33]Know I'll find you in my dreams
{"请知晓我会在梦中寻到你"}
[01:11.58]Find you in my dreams
{"在梦中寻到你"}
[01:23.13]Walking in the distance
{"远去的脚步"}
